+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use an LRU (Least Recently Used) cache eviction policy with a 300-second time-to-live (TTL). The rationale recorded for this decision is that LRU is simpler to reason about and easier to tune for the workload.
